<title>USA: Banyan annual meeting adjourned to Dec 27.</title>
<headline>Banyan annual meeting adjourned to Dec 27.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banyan Mortgage Investment Fund said the company on December 18 adjourned its annual stockholders meeting to December 27 at 1000 CST.</p>
<p>It said no substantive action was taken at the December 18 session.</p>
<p>The company is reviewing unsolicited offers to acquire all of its outstanding shares.</p>
<p>		  ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
